# 친구용 Supabase 무료 프로젝트가 7일 동안 DB 요청이 없으면 일시정지되는 것을 막는다.
# supabase/friends-keepalive.sql의 keepalive() 함수(데이터를 읽지 않고 1만 돌려줌)를 하루 한 번 부른다.
[Unit]
Description=Keep the friends' Supabase project active (daily DB call)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target
ConditionPathExists=/etc/our-places/env

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=ourplaces
Group=ourplaces
EnvironmentFile=/etc/our-places/env
ExecStart=/usr/bin/curl -fsS -m 30 -o /dev/null -H "apikey: ${SUPABASE_KEY}" "${SUPABASE_URL}/rest/v1/rpc/keepalive"
NoNewPrivileges=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=true
PrivateTmp=true
PrivateDevices=true
CapabilityBoundingSet=
ProtectKernelTunables=true
ProtectKernelModules=true
ProtectKernelLogs=true
ProtectControlGroups=true
ProtectClock=true
ProtectHostname=true
RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_INET AF_INET6 AF_UNIX
RestrictNamespaces=true
RestrictRealtime=true
RestrictSUIDSGID=true
LockPersonality=true
MemoryDenyWriteExecute=true
SystemCallArchitectures=native
SystemCallFilter=@system-service
SystemCallErrorNumber=EPERM
ProtectProc=invisible
RemoveIPC=true
UMask=0077
